Y', price $285, and total $285.00.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-9\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"As QA Buyer, opened Message Seller dialog on Marcus Chen's 'Vintage Denim Jacket' (not owned by buyer), Send Message button was disabled with empty text, typed a non-empty message and Send Message became enabled; clicking it showed toast 'Message sent to seller!' confirming submission.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-21\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Category selection from categories page does not filter browse results\", \"actual\": \"Navigating to /categories showed 'Furniture 3 items'. Clicking the Furniture category card navigated to /?category=furniture, but the Browse page displayed all 10 items (browse.count = '10 items available'), not the expected 3 furniture items. The Furniture checkbox in browse.filters.categories remained unchecked (value: false), confirming the category query param is not being read/applied to the filter state.\", \"evidence\": \"categories.grid.item.furniture showed count '3 items'; after click, URL=/?category=furniture, browse.count='10 items available', browse.filters.categories.item.furniture.value=false\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-22\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No seller-facing view exists for purchase requests or buyer messages\", \"actual\": \"As buyer, sent a direct 'Message Seller' text to Marcus Chen and submitted a cart Send Purchase Request for 2 items (one from Marcus Chen); both produced buyer-side confirmation toasts ('Message sent to seller!' and 'Purchase requests sent to sellers!'). However, logging in as seller Marcus Chen, there is no way to view these: the user menu only offers My Profile (which 404s - 'Oops! Page not found'), My Listings (shows only View/Mark Sold/Delete, no requests/messages), and the product detail page for an owned listing shows no message/requests section. No notification icon or inbox exists in the header. The cart-checkout 'reported as sent' behavior could be observed (toast + cart cleared), but the first half of the requirement - sellers viewing the requested item and buyer message - is not implemented anywhere in the UI.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-10\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Attempted login with unregistered email 'nonexistent.user.qa@example.com' + password 'somepassword123'. Toast notification appeared: 'Invalid credentials. Try: emma@example.com'. User remained on /login with the form still populated/available; no session was created (no redirect, no header user-menu change).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Registered 'qa.credtest@example.com' successfully. Then attempted to register again with case-varied email 'QA.CredTest@example.com' (different name/password/location). Registration was rejected with toast 'An account with this email already exists'; stayed on /register; no new session created (existing account was not replaced - confirmed original account credentials still separately testable).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-12\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Registered account accepts incorrect password\", \"actual\": \"Registered a fresh account (qa.credtest@example.com / password 'CorrectPass123'), logged out, then attempted login with the same email but WRONG password 'WrongPassword999'. Login succeeded: toast 'Welcome back!' appeared, page redirected to '/', and header showed the authenticated user-menu button 'QA Cred Tester'. Password verification is not enforced for self-registered accounts (any password is accepted, similar to demo accounts, but this was NOT one of the documented demo accounts).\", \"evidence\": \"Toast: 'Welcome back!'; header button ref=e4339 labeled 'QA Cred Tester' after submitting login.email=qa.credtest@example.com, login.password=WrongPassword999 (not the registered password)\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"As buyer QA Buyer (not owner), viewing Emma Green's listing 'Mid-Century Modern Armchair' shows only Add to Cart and Message Seller actions - no Mark Sold/Delete/Manage-Listings controls. Earlier, when QA Seller viewed/managed their own listing, Mark Sold, Delete (on My Listings) and 'Manage Your Listings' link (on product detail) were present. Seller-management actions are thus scoped to the owning seller only.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Submitting fully empty form kept native required-field validation active (e.g. title element.validationMessage='Please fill out this field'); submitting with title/description/price/category/condition/location filled but no photo produced toast 'Please add at least one image' and no listing was created (still on create-listing page).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Filled create-listing form (title, description, category=Furniture, condition=Good, photo added) with Price='-50' and clicked Create Listing. Form did not submit; stayed on /create-listing. Price input has native HTML5 validation: type='number', min='0', validity.rangeUnderflow=true, validationMessage='Value must be greater than or equal to 0.' Confirmed no listing was created by checking My Listings page, which showed 'No listings yet'.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-23\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Direct navigation to protected routes while signed out renders a blank page instead of a sign-in prompt or redirect\", \"actual\": \"While logged out: clicking 'Add to Cart' on a product correctly redirected to /login with toast 'Please log in to add items to your cart', and opening 'Message Seller' correctly showed the dialog with a disabled 'Log in to message' button - both good. However, directly navigating (URL entry / deep link) to protected routes /create-listing and /cart while unauthenticated rendered a completely blank page (no header, no content, no redirect, no message) rather than being blocked with a clear sign-in prompt or redirect.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Duplicate-email registration attempt produced an immediate, visible toast notification ('An account with this email already exists') and the registration form remained fully populated and available on /register for the user to correct the email and resubmit, without any page reload or data loss.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Typing into search box (no Enter/submit) immediately filtered browse.products and updated browse.count (e.g. 'denim' -> '1 items available' instantly); clearing the field immediately restored 'ureka10 items available' / full result set, all without a separate search submission.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-18\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"All filter/sort interactions updated browse.products and browse.count immediately without any submit action: upcycled toggle, category checkbox (furniture), condition checkbox, price min slider (Home/ArrowRight), distance slider (Home/ArrowRight/End: 1mi=0 items, 3mi=2 items, 4mi=3 items, Any=10 items), and sort dropdown (newest/price-low ascending $35..$320/price-high descending $320..$35/distance grouped by city). 'Clear all filters' button correctly restored all controls to default and full 10-item unfiltered list.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-19\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Clicking Add to Cart immediately showed toast 'Added to cart!' and updated header cart count to '1' without reload; navigating to cart page (no manual reload) shows the line item and correct $285.00 total.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-20\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\"